  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Named action with shared control corners, a 44px target and visible keyboard focus.",
      "html": "<button dir=\"rtl\" class=\"ds-button-primary\">שמירה</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary{font-family:var(--sans,Heebo,sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;min-height:44px;padding:.5rem .95rem;border:1px solid var(--accent,#126B78);border-radius:var(--radius,8px);background:var(--accent,#126B78);color:var(--on-accent,#FFFFFF);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;transition:background .14s ease,border-color .14s ease;}.ds-button-primary:hover{background:var(--accent-hover,#0C5360);color:var(--on-accent,#FFFFFF);border-color:var(--accent-hover,#0C5360);}.ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#126B78);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-button-primary:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-primary{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Named action with shared control corners, a 44px target and visible keyboard focus.",
      "html": "<button dir=\"rtl\" class=\"ds-button-secondary\">ביטול</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-secondary{font-family:var(--sans,Heebo,sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;min-height:44px;padding:.5rem .95rem;border:1px solid var(--line-strong,#93A4B8);border-radius:var(--radius,8px);background:var(--paper-light,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#1D2B3D);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;transition:background .14s ease,border-color .14s ease;}.ds-button-secondary:hover{background:var(--paper-deep,#EAF0F6);color:var(--ink,#1D2B3D);border-color:var(--line-strong,#93A4B8);}.ds-button-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#126B78);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-button-secondary:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-secondary{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Destructive Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-danger",
      "description": "Named action with shared control corners, a 44px target and visible keyboard focus.",
      "html": "<button dir=\"rtl\" class=\"ds-button-danger\">מחיקה</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-danger{font-family:var(--sans,Heebo,sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;min-height:44px;padding:.5rem .95rem;border:1px solid var(--vermilion,#B13443);border-radius:var(--radius,8px);background:var(--vermilion,#B13443);color:#FFFFFF;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;transition:background .14s ease,border-color .14s ease;}.ds-button-danger:hover{background:var(--vermilion,#B13443);color:#FFFFFF;border-color:var(--vermilion,#B13443);}.ds-button-danger:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#126B78);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-button-danger:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-danger{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Labeled Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Visible medium-weight Hebrew label, 48px minimum field and strong neutral boundary.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\" dir=\"rtl\">שם האתר<input dir=\"auto\" placeholder=\"שם האתר\" /></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{font-family:var(--sans,Heebo,sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:grid;gap:.4rem;color:var(--ink,#1D2B3D);font-size:.88rem;font-weight:500;}.ds-field input{font-family:var(--sans,Heebo,sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:0;min-height:48px;padding:.5rem .65rem;border:1px solid var(--line-strong,#93A4B8);border-radius:var(--radius,8px);background:var(--paper-light,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#1D2B3D);font-size:1rem;caret-color:var(--accent,#126B78);}.ds-field input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#126B78);outline-offset:3px;border-color:var(--accent,#126B78);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workspace Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-selected",
      "description": "Slate desktop workspace/operations groups; at 900px, five mobile destinations put services/settings behind More. This static preview shows navigation appearance.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" dir=\"rtl\" aria-label=\"ניווט ראשי\"><span class=\"ds-nav-section\">סביבת עבודה</span><a href=\"#visitors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20M2 12h20\"/></svg><span>אתרים</span></a><a href=\"#clients\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"/></svg><span>לקוחות</span></a><a href=\"#vault\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"8\" r=\"5\"/><path d=\"m12.5 11.5-9 9H1v-2.5l9-9M16 8h.01\"/></svg><span>כספת</span></a><span class=\"ds-nav-section ds-nav-operations\">תפעול</span><a href=\"#infrastructure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 6.5h.01M7 17.5h.01\"/></svg><span>שרת ומשאבים</span></a><a href=\"#services\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.8-3.8a6 6 0 0 1-7.9 7.9l-8.4 8.4a2.1 2.1 0 0 1-3-3l8.4-8.4a6 6 0 0 1 7.9-7.9z\"/></svg><span>שירותים</span></a><a href=\"#settings\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8\"/><path d=\"M9 3h6l1 3 3 1 2 5-2 5-3 1-1 3H9l-1-3-3-1-2-5 2-5 3-1z\"/></svg><span>הגדרות</span></a></nav><nav class=\"ds-mobile-nav\" dir=\"rtl\" aria-label=\"ניווט נייד\"><a href=\"#visitors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20M2 12h20\"/></svg><span>אתרים</span></a><a href=\"#clients\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"/></svg><span>לקוחות</span></a><a href=\"#vault\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"8\" r=\"5\"/><path d=\"m12.5 11.5-9 9H1v-2.5l9-9M16 8h.01\"/></svg><span>כספת</span></a><a href=\"#infrastructure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 6.5h.01M7 17.5h.01\"/></svg><span>שרת</span></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"/></svg><span>עוד</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav,.ds-mobile-nav{font-family:var(--sans,Heebo,sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;background:var(--rail-bg,#192638);}.ds-nav{display:grid;gap:.35rem;width:15rem;max-width:100%;padding:1.3rem .9rem;}.ds-nav-section{color:var(--rail-muted,#B9C6D6);padding:0 .75rem .5rem;font-size:.75rem;}.ds-nav-operations{margin-block-start:1.25rem;}.ds-nav a,.ds-mobile-nav a,.ds-mobile-nav button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;min-height:48px;padding:.65rem .8rem;border:0;border-radius:var(--radius,8px);color:var(--rail-muted,#B9C6D6);background:transparent;font:500 .95rem var(--sans,Heebo,sans-serif);text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;}.ds-nav a:hover,.ds-mobile-nav a:hover,.ds-mobile-nav button:hover{background:#25364B;color:#FFFFFF;}.ds-nav a[aria-current],.ds-mobile-nav a[aria-current]{background:var(--rail-active,#263D4D);color:#EDF9FA;font-weight:700;}.ds-nav a[aria-current] svg,.ds-mobile-nav a[aria-current] svg{color:var(--rail-accent,#8AD8DF);}.ds-nav a:focus-visible,.ds-mobile-nav :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--rail-accent,#8AD8DF);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-mobile-nav{display:none;}@media(max-width:900px){.ds-nav{display:none;}.ds-mobile-nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));padding:.3rem;}.ds-mobile-nav a,.ds-mobile-nav button{flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:.2rem;padding:.45rem .2rem;min-height:58px;font-size:.7rem;border-radius:0;}.ds-mobile-nav svg{width:20px;height:20px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Written Health State",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip-healthy",
      "description": "Compact operational health with a written state; never a decorative badge or a traffic trend.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-health\" dir=\"rtl\">פעיל</span>",
      "css": ".ds-health{font-family:var(--sans,Heebo,sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:.2rem .5rem;border-radius:6px;background:var(--healthy-surface,#EDF7F1);color:var(--healthy,#24734F);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Data Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "A single subtle boundary around a dataset, with the same structure in graphite infrastructure.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-panels\" dir=\"rtl\"><section class=\"ds-panel\"><header><h2>פעילות</h2></header><div class=\"ds-panel-body\">נתונים מופיעים כאן</div></section><section class=\"ds-panel ds-panel-graphite\"><header><h2>צריכת משאבים</h2></header><div class=\"ds-panel-body\">RAM · Swap</div></section></div>",
      "css": ".ds-panels{font-family:var(--sans,Heebo,sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:grid;gap:1.25rem;}.ds-panel{background:var(--paper-light,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#1D2B3D);border:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);border-radius:var(--panel-radius,12px);box-shadow:none;overflow:hidden;}.ds-panel header{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:58px;padding:.8rem 1.2rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);}.ds-panel h2{margin:0;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;}.ds-panel-body{padding:1.2rem;font-size:1rem;color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);}.ds-panel-graphite{--paper-light:#1A2939;--ink:#EDF3FA;--ink-muted:#B2C0D0;--line:#354B60;}@media(max-width:480px){.ds-panel header,.ds-panel-body{padding:.85rem;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Summary Strip",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "summary",
      "description": "White primary values and aligned separators; placeholders avoid copying live measurements.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-summary\" dir=\"rtl\" aria-label=\"מדדים מרכזיים\"><article><span>מבקרים משוערים</span><strong>—</strong></article><article><span>ביקורים</span><strong>—</strong></article><article><span>צפיות</span><strong>—</strong></article></section>",
      "css": ".ds-summary{font-family:var(--sans,Heebo,sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));background:var(--paper-light,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#1D2B3D);border:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);border-radius:var(--panel-radius,12px);}.ds-summary article{min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem;padding:1.05rem 1.3rem;border-inline-end:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);}.ds-summary article:last-child{border-inline-end:0;}.ds-summary span{color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.4;font-weight:400;}.ds-summary strong{font-size:2rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:0;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-summary article{gap:.35rem;}.ds-summary span{min-height:2.1rem;}}@media(max-width:480px){.ds-summary article{padding:.8rem .65rem;}.ds-summary strong{font-size:1.7rem;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Vault List and Detail",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Synthetic selected credential appearance. The production vault has a right list/left detail above 1000px and separate list/detail views below it; runtime copy/reveal behavior remains in Vault.jsx.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-vault\" dir=\"rtl\"><section class=\"ds-vault-list\" aria-label=\"פרטי גישה\"><label class=\"ds-vault-search\">חיפוש<input placeholder=\"אפליקציה, משתמש או כתובת\" /></label><button class=\"ds-vault-row\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-vault-initial\">D</span><span><b>Demo app</b><small dir=\"ltr\">demo@example.test</small></span><small>ייצור</small></button></section><section class=\"ds-vault-detail\"><h2 dir=\"ltr\">Demo app</h2><div class=\"ds-vault-value\"><label>שם משתמש</label><div><bdi dir=\"ltr\">demo@example.test</bdi><button aria-label=\"העתקת שם משתמש\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M4 16H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"ds-vault-value\"><label>סיסמה</label><div><bdi dir=\"ltr\">••••••••••••</bdi><button aria-label=\"הצגת סיסמה\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7S2 12 2 12\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg></button><button aria-label=\"העתקת סיסמה\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M4 16H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div></div><a class=\"ds-vault-open\" href=\"https://example.test\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">פתיחת אתר</a><small>נתוני הדגמה</small></section></div>",
      "css": ".ds-vault{font-family:var(--sans,Heebo,sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(290px,360px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.15rem;color:var(--ink,#1D2B3D);}.ds-vault-list,.ds-vault-detail{min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);border-radius:var(--panel-radius,12px);background:var(--paper-light,#FFFFFF);overflow:hidden;}.ds-vault-search{display:grid;gap:.4rem;padding:1rem;color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);font-size:.84rem;border-block-end:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);}.ds-vault-search input{font:inherit;min-width:0;min-height:44px;color:var(--ink,#1D2B3D);background:transparent;border:0;}.ds-vault-row{display:flex;width:100%;gap:.8rem;align-items:center;text-align:start;padding:1rem;border:0;background:var(--selected,#E8F4F5);color:inherit;font:inherit;cursor:pointer;}.ds-vault-row:hover{background:var(--row-hover,#F0F8F9);}.ds-vault-row>span:nth-child(2){display:grid;gap:.2rem;flex:1;min-width:0;}.ds-vault-row b{font-size:.98rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-vault-row small,.ds-vault-detail>small{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-vault-initial{display:grid;place-items:center;width:40px;height:40px;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);border-radius:10px;background:var(--paper-light,#FFFFFF);color:var(--accent,#126B78);font-weight:600;}.ds-vault-detail{display:grid;align-content:start;gap:1.35rem;padding:1.5rem;}.ds-vault-detail h2{margin:0;text-align:start;font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.5;}.ds-vault-value>label{display:block;font-size:.84rem;color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);margin-block-end:.4rem;}.ds-vault-value>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.25rem;min-height:52px;padding:.2rem .65rem;border:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);border-radius:8px;background:var(--paper,#F2F5F9);}.ds-vault-value bdi{min-width:0;flex:1;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-vault-value button{display:grid;place-items:center;min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);cursor:pointer;}.ds-vault-value button:hover{background:var(--paper-deep,#EAF0F6);color:var(--ink,#1D2B3D);}.ds-vault-open{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-self:start;min-height:44px;padding-inline:.95rem;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent,#126B78);color:var(--on-accent,#FFFFFF);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;}.ds-vault-open:hover{background:var(--accent-hover,#0C5360);}.ds-vault :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#126B78);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:1200px){.ds-vault{grid-template-columns:300px minmax(0,1fr);}.ds-vault-detail{padding:1.15rem;}}@media(max-width:1000px){.ds-vault{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.ds-vault-list{display:none;}.ds-vault-detail{min-height:65dvh;}}@media(max-width:480px){.ds-vault-detail{padding:1rem;}.ds-vault-detail h2{font-size:1.15rem;}.ds-vault-value bdi{font-size:.95rem;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Site Comparison",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "A generic zero-data example with one aligned header, neutral change and a zero-fill measured activity bar.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-comparison\" dir=\"rtl\"><div class=\"ds-comparison-head\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>אתר</span><span>אומדן</span><span>ביקורים</span><span>צפיות</span><span class=\"ds-comparison-change\">שינוי</span><span></span></div><a class=\"ds-comparison-row\" href=\"#example\" aria-label=\"אתר לדוגמה, אומדן 0, ביקורים 0, צפיות 0, אין קודמים\"><b class=\"ds-comparison-name\">אתר לדוגמה</b><strong>0</strong><span class=\"ds-comparison-activity\"><strong>0</strong><i aria-hidden=\"true\"><em></em></i></span><strong>0</strong><span class=\"ds-comparison-change\">אין קודמים</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"/></svg></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-comparison{font-family:var(--sans,Heebo,sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;border:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);border-radius:var(--panel-radius,12px);background:var(--paper-light,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#1D2B3D);overflow:hidden;}.ds-comparison-head,.ds-comparison-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(9rem,1.65fr) repeat(3,minmax(4rem,.8fr)) minmax(7rem,1fr) 1rem;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;padding-inline:1.1rem;}.ds-comparison-head{padding-block:.65rem;background:var(--paper-deep,#EAF0F6);color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);font-size:.73rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);}.ds-comparison-row{min-height:56px;padding-block:.7rem;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}.ds-comparison-row:hover{background:var(--row-hover,#F0F8F9);}.ds-comparison-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#126B78);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-comparison-name{font-size:.9rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-comparison-row strong{font-size:1.12rem;}.ds-comparison-activity{display:grid;gap:.3rem;justify-items:start;}.ds-comparison-activity i{display:block;width:3.5rem;max-width:100%;height:4px;background:var(--line,#D7E0EA);border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;}.ds-comparison-activity em{display:block;width:0;height:100%;background:var(--accent,#126B78);}.ds-comparison-change{font-size:.74rem;color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);}.ds-comparison-row>svg{color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-comparison-head,.ds-comparison-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) repeat(3,2.85rem) .6rem;gap:.3rem;padding-inline:.7rem;}.ds-comparison-head{font-size:.67rem;}.ds-comparison-head>span:not(:first-child){text-align:center;}.ds-comparison-head .ds-comparison-change{display:none;}.ds-comparison-row{min-height:72px;row-gap:.3rem;}.ds-comparison-name{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.5;}.ds-comparison-row>strong,.ds-comparison-activity{grid-row:1/3;text-align:center;justify-self:center;}.ds-comparison-row>strong:nth-child(2){grid-column:2;}.ds-comparison-activity{grid-column:3;justify-items:center;}.ds-comparison-row>strong:nth-child(4){grid-column:4;}.ds-comparison-row strong{font-size:1.05rem;}.ds-comparison-activity i{width:2rem;height:3px;}.ds-comparison-row .ds-comparison-change{grid-column:1;grid-row:2;font-size:.68rem;}.ds-comparison-row>svg{grid-column:5;grid-row:1/3;width:13px;}}@media(max-width:380px){.ds-comparison-head,.ds-comparison-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) repeat(3,2.55rem) .6rem;gap:.2rem;padding-inline:.55rem;}.ds-comparison-head{font-size:.64rem;}.ds-comparison-name{font-size:.76rem;}} .ds-comparison-head{font-size:.78rem;}.ds-comparison-row{min-height:67px;padding-block:.9rem;}.ds-comparison-name{font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;}.ds-comparison-row strong{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-comparison-row{min-height:72px;}}@media(max-width:480px){.ds-comparison-row{padding-inline:.85rem;}.ds-comparison-name{font-size:.95rem;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "חדר בקרה חד וברור",
    "overview": "A compact fleet console makes website activity, client work, shared credentials and server attention easy to scan. Porcelain canvas, white data surfaces, slate navigation and petrol actions put aligned numbers and useful controls first. Short Hebrew nouns, contextual icons and explanations on demand keep the interface practical for a daily check.\n\nWebsite activity, client follow-up, the team vault, services, settings and authentication share the light system. Infrastructure uses graphite surfaces with the same components, density and interaction grammar. The vault has one desktop list/detail workspace and separate mobile views; its approved [desktop composition](.impeccable/mocks/vault-desktop.png) and [approval record](.impeccable/mocks/vault-desktop.json) establish spatial direction, while semantic Hebrew and functional controls follow the implementation.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Hebrew RTL, self-hosted Heebo and aligned tabular numbers.",
      "White summaries, tables and plots with subtle boundaries and gently rounded panels.",
      "Stable slate navigation, petrol actions and functional green, amber and red states.",
      "Compact comparison rows, measured activity bars, a responsive credential list/detail and explanations on demand."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep numbers, dates and controls visible before explanatory copy.",
      "**Do** compose screens from shared components and local surface/status tokens.",
      "**Do** verify desktop and mobile layouts, keyboard focus, 44px targets and readable contrast.",
      "**Do** retain source distinctions, failures and measurement uncertainty in concise Hebrew.",
      "**Do** keep infrastructure graphite and email presentation separately grounded in their source."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** restore charcoal summaries or plots to the light workspace, square panel rules or a dark login treatment.",
      "**Don't** add decorative animation, gradients, glass, glow, page eyebrows, decorative badges or new visual libraries.",
      "**Don't** repeat metric icons or explanatory paragraphs in each row.",
      "**Don't** imply that an estimate is a confirmed person, a click is an inquiry or a traffic change is a business outcome.",
      "**Don't** introduce tracking or database behavior merely to support a visual redesign."
    ]
  }
}
